  "text": "### Currency Transaction Report (CTR)  \n**When to File:**\n- Any transaction >£10,000 in cash\n- Within 5 business days\n- To FCA  \n**What to Report:**\n- Customer name and ID\n- Transaction date and amount\n- Transaction purpose (if known)\n- Whether customer is new or existing  \n**Example:** Customer withdraws £15,000 in cash → File CTR",
